[gd_scene format=3]

; The Bellows, under the Ashfall (map offset (291, -167)): the lung of the foundry, a bellows the size of a nave, still
; heaving. The hatch from the Ashfall drops in by a stair of gantries (the way back up, needing nothing). East, the
; bellows' iron frame stands to the high ledge and the door on to the Foundry: climbed by its metal (Mag-grip) or by the
; rings along its ribs (Harpoon). A shrine rests under the bellows.

